            <ArticleTitle>Coronary artery aneurysms: case report and review of transcatheter management strategies.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>E469-76</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/ccd.24856</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>There is no consensus on the best management of coronary artery aneurysms (CAA) in adults. We describe two patients with CAA and review transcatheter approaches to exclude them from the circulation.</AbstractText>
